  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 5.581,
      "end": 10.902,
      "en": "Freedom of expression is one of the essential pillars of democracy.",
      "ja": "expression の自由は民主主義の重要な柱の 1 つです。"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.202,
      "end": 14.602,
      "en": "But how far should that freedom extend?",
      "ja": "しかし、その自由はどこまで拡張されるべきでしょうか?"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.762,
      "end": 22.483,
      "en": "This is one of the most controversial questions in modern society.",
      "ja": "これは現代社会で最も物議を醸している質問の 1 つです。"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.204,
      "end": 30.604,
      "en": "Hate speech, discriminatory expression, and deliberate misinformation.",
      "ja": "ヘイトスピーチ、差別的 expression、意図的な誤った情報。"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.965,
      "end": 36.405,
      "en": "Should these fall within the range of free speech?",
      "ja": "これらは言論の自由の範囲内にあるのでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.746,
      "end": 43.607,
      "en": "Many countries have placed limitations on forms of expression that cause harm.",
      "ja": "多くの国では、危害を及ぼす expression 形式に limitations を設けています。"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.907,
      "end": 49.028,
      "en": "On the other hand, regulation carries the danger of excess.",
      "ja": "一方で、規制には行き過ぎの危険性も伴います。"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.328,
      "end": 58.729,
      "en": "If a government controls expression too much, citizens become afraid and stop raising their voices.",
